<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Viktor Borisov — Compliance & Regulatory Affairs Officer</title>
<meta name="description" content="Viktor Borisov — Compliance and Regulatory Affairs Officer with six years of experience across financial crime, investigations, and regulatory compliance. ISO 27001 Internal Auditor. Reading for Law at Burgas Free University.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    /* Classic, professional palette: deep navy-charcoal + warm champagne gold */
    --bg: #0E1218;
    --bg-card: #161B23;
    --bg-elev: #1F2630;
    --bg-soft: #262D38;
    --ink: #F0EBE0;
    --ink-soft: #B8B3A8;
    --ink-faint: #6E6A60;
    --lime: #C9A961;           /* champagne gold (var name kept for simplicity) */
    --lime-deep: #B08D43;      /* deeper antique gold */
    --line: rgba(240, 235, 224, 0.08);
    --line-strong: rgba(240, 235, 224, 0.16);
    --display: 'Manrope', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    --serif: 'Lora', 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;
    --logo: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Cormorant', 'Garamond', serif;
    --sans: 'Manrope', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 200;
    opacity: 0.05;
    mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='2' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ============ NAV ============ */
  .nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 16px; left: 16px; right: 16px;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(14, 14, 14, 0.72);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(140%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(140%);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 12px 14px 12px 24px;
    max-width: 1320px;
    margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .nav-brand {
    font-family: var(--logo);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .nav-brand .dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    background: var(--lime);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.5);
  }

  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }

  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.25s;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--lime); }

  .nav-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: var(--lime);
    color: #0E0E0E;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 11px 20px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: all 0.25s;
  }

  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--ink); }
  .nav-cta::after {
    content: "↗";
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: transform 0.25s;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover::after { transform: translate(2px, -2px); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    .nav { border-radius: 24px; }
  }

  /* ============ HERO ============ */
  .hero { padding: 120px 0 60px; position: relative; }

  .hero-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .hero-intro b {
    color: var(--lime);
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .hero-intro em {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .hero-headline-block { text-align: right; }

  .hero-headline-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .hero-headline-block h2 .lime { color: var(--lime); }

  /* ============ HERO LOGO ============ */
  .hero-logo {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 0 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .logo-name {
    font-family: var(--logo);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 116px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    padding-left: 0.18em;       /* optical balance for trailing letter-spacing */
  }

  .logo-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .logo-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--ink-soft);
    opacity: 0.45;
  }

  .logo-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--lime);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .logo-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--logo);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.2vw, 15px);
    letter-spacing: 0.42em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 0.42em;       /* optical balance */
  }

  /* On phones, tighten letter-spacing so logo fits comfortably */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .logo-name {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 10vw, 60px);
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .logo-divider { gap: 12px; padding: 0 8px; }
    .logo-subtitle {
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    }
  }

  .feature-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .portrait {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 620px;
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  /* Portrait photo */
  .portrait-photo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;  /* photo is pre-cropped with face near top, shoulders & suit fill below */
    z-index: 0;
    filter: brightness(0.96) contrast(1.02);
    transition: filter 0.6s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
  }

  /* Bottom gradient: keeps face fully visible, only darkens the suit area where text sits */
  .portrait::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(14, 18, 24, 0.0) 0%,
      rgba(14, 18, 24, 0.0) 60%,
      rgba(14, 18, 24, 0.5) 78%,
      rgba(14, 18, 24, 0.92) 100%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .portrait:hover .portrait-photo {
    transform: scale(1.02);
    filter: brightness(1.0) contrast(1.05);
  }

  .portrait-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .portrait-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .portrait-tagline {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--ink);
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .portrait-tagline em {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--lime);
    font-size: 0.95em;
  }

  .portrait-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: var(--lime);
    color: #0E1218;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -8px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.4);
  }

  .portrait-cta::after { content: "→"; transition: transform 0.3s; }
  .portrait-cta:hover { background: var(--ink); }
  .portrait-cta:hover::after { transform: translateX(4px); }

  /* On smaller screens stack the tagline and CTA vertically */
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .portrait-footer {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .portrait-cta { align-self: flex-start; }
  }

  .seal {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px; right: 24px;
    width: 110px; height: 110px;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .seal svg {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    animation: spin 30s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

  .stats-column { display: grid; gap: 16px; }

  .stat-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px;
    position: relative;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }

  .stat-card:hover { border-color: var(--lime); }

  .stat-card-headline {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .stat-card-headline em {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--lime);
  }

  .stat-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }

  .stat-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .stat-row-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .stat-row-value {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--lime);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .stat-row-value sup {
    font-size: 0.5em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-left: 2px;
  }

  .trust-strip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.4vw, 16px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  .trust-strip span:nth-child(odd) { color: var(--ink); }
  .trust-strip span:nth-child(even) {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: left; }
    .hero-headline-block { text-align: left; }
    .feature-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .portrait { min-height: 420px; padding: 28px; }
    .seal { width: 80px; height: 80px; top: 16px; right: 16px; }
  }

  /* ============ SECTIONS ============ */
  section { padding: 120px 0; position: relative; }

  .section-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .section-meta .dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    background: var(--lime);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .section-title em {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--lime);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    section { padding: 80px 0; }
    .section-title { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  }

  /* ============ ABOUT ============ */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .about-text {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 48px;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .about-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .about-text p strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  /* the lead paragraph — now Lora regular (not italic) for readability */
  .about-text .lead {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about-text .lead .lime { color: var(--lime); font-weight: 600; }

  .about-meta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }

  .meta-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px;
  }

  .meta-card-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .meta-card-value {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .meta-card-value em {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--lime);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .meta-card.accent {
    background: var(--lime);
    color: #0E0E0E;
    border-color: var(--lime);
  }

  .meta-card.accent .meta-card-label { color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 0.6); }
  .meta-card.accent .meta-card-value { color: #0E0E0E; }
  .meta-card.accent .meta-card-value em { color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 0.75); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-text { padding: 32px; }
  }

  /* ============ EXPERIENCE ============ */
  .experience-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }

  .role {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
    transition: all 0.35s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .role::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 3px;
    background: var(--lime);
    transform: scaleY(0);
    transform-origin: top;
    transition: transform 0.4s;
  }

  .role:hover {
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
  }

  .role:hover::before { transform: scaleY(1); }

  .role-dates {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lime);
  }

  .role-dates .current {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--lime);
    color: #0E0E0E;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .role-title h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .role-current {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    background: var(--lime);
    color: #0E1218;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .role-org {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .role-description {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .role-description ul { list-style: none; }

  .role-description li {
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .role-description li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 9px;
    width: 12px; height: 1px;
    background: var(--lime);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .role { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 28px; }
    .role-title h3 { font-size: 26px; }
  }

  /* ============ EDUCATION ============ */
  .edu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .edu-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .edu-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--lime);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .edu-card.current {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--lime) 0%, var(--lime-deep) 100%);
    color: #0E0E0E;
    border: none;
  }

  .edu-card.current .edu-label,
  .edu-card.current .edu-period { color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 0.6); }

  .edu-card.current h3,
  .edu-card.current .edu-institution,
  .edu-card.current p { color: #0E0E0E; }

  .edu-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lime);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .edu-label::before {
    content: "";
    width: 8px; height: 8px;
    background: currentColor;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .edu-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .edu-institution {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .edu-card p {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .credentials-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px;
  }

  .credentials-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .credentials-header h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .credentials-header h3 em {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--lime);
  }

  .credentials-count {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .credential-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .credential-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    border-radius: 14px;
    transition: all 0.25s;
  }

  .credential-item:hover {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .credential-mark {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    background: var(--lime);
    color: #0E1218;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .credential-detail {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .credential-name {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .credential-issuer {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .edu-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .credential-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* ============ EXPERTISE ============ */
  .expertise-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .expertise-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .expertise-card:hover { border-color: var(--lime); }

  .expertise-card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%; right: -50%;
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.06) 0%, transparent 60%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .expertise-card:hover::after { opacity: 1; }

  .expertise-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .expertise-num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lime);
  }

  .expertise-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .expertise-blurb {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .skill-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }

  .skill-tag {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    border-radius: 100px;
    transition: all 0.25s;
  }

  .skill-tag:hover {
    background: var(--lime);
    color: #0E0E0E;
    border-color: var(--lime);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .expertise-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .expertise-card { padding: 28px; }
  }

  /* ============ CONTACT ============ */
  .contact-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 32px;
    padding: 64px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -120px; right: -120px;
    width: 340px; height: 340px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.18) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* "Arrived" pulse: subtle gold glow when visitor scrolls here via CTA */
  @keyframes arrivalPulse {
    0%   { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(201, 169, 97, 0); }
    25%  { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.18); }
    100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(201, 169, 97, 0); }
  }

  .contact-card.arrived {
    animation: arrivalPulse 1.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .contact-headline {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .contact-headline em {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--lime);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .contact-sub {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .contact-methods { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }

  .contact-method {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .contact-method:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .contact-method-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .contact-method a, .contact-method span {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    transition: color 0.25s;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .contact-method a:hover { color: var(--lime); }

  .contact-form {
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .form-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .form-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  .form-field label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .form-field input, .form-field textarea {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.25s;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .form-field input::placeholder, .form-field textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .form-field input:focus, .form-field textarea:focus {
    border-bottom-color: var(--lime);
  }

  .form-field textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 90px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
  }

  .form-field--full { margin-bottom: 16px; }

  .submit-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 16px 28px;
    background: var(--lime);
    color: #0E0E0E;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .submit-btn:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .submit-btn::after { content: "→"; transition: transform 0.3s; }
  .submit-btn:hover::after { transform: translateX(4px); }

  .form-status {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lime);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s;
    min-height: 16px;
  }

  .form-status.visible { opacity: 1; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .contact-card { padding: 32px; border-radius: 24px; }
    .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .contact-form { padding: 24px; }
  }

  /* ============ FOOTER ============ */
  footer {
    padding: 48px 0 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 80px;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--logo);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  /* ============ ANIMATIONS ============ */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .hero-intro, .hero-headline-block, .hero-logo, .feature-row, .trust-strip {
    animation: fadeUp 1s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) backwards;
  }

  .hero-intro { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
  .hero-headline-block { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
  .hero-logo { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
  .feature-row { animation-delay: 0.7s; }
  .trust-strip { animation-delay: 0.9s; }

  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(28px);
    transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
  }

  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  /* ============ COMPREHENSIVE MOBILE OVERRIDES ============ */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .container { padding: 0 20px; }
    .nav {
      top: 12px; left: 12px; right: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px 10px 18px;
    }
    .nav-brand { font-size: 16px; }
    .nav-cta { padding: 9px 16px; font-size: 12px; }
    .hero { padding: 100px 0 40px; }
    section { padding: 64px 0; }
    .hero-top { margin-bottom: 32px; gap: 20px; }
    .hero-intro { font-size: 18px; }
    .hero-headline-block h2 { font-size: 26px; }
    .feature-row { gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .portrait { min-height: 480px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .portrait-tagline { font-size: 22px; }
    .portrait-cta { padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 13px; }
    .seal { width: 64px; height: 64px; top: 14px; right: 14px; }
    .stat-card { padding: 22px; border-radius: 16px; }
    .stat-card-headline { font-size: 19px; }
    .stat-row-value { font-size: 26px; }
    .trust-strip { padding: 18px 0; gap: 10px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; }
    .trust-strip span:nth-child(even) { font-size: 11px; }
    .section-title { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .about-text { padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .about-text .lead { font-size: 19px; padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .about-text p { font-size: 15.5px; }
    .meta-card { padding: 22px; border-radius: 16px; }
    .meta-card-value { font-size: 18px; }
    .role { padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; gap: 20px; }
    .role-title h3 { font-size: 21px; }
    .edu-card { padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .edu-card h3 { font-size: 24px; }
    .edu-institution { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .credentials-card { padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .credentials-header h3 { font-size: 20px; }
    .credential-item { padding: 14px 16px; gap: 12px; }
    .credential-mark { width: 32px; height: 32px; font-size: 16px; }
    .credential-name { font-size: 13.5px; }
    .credential-issuer { font-size: 11.5px; }
    .expertise-card { padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .expertise-card h3 { font-size: 24px; }
    .expertise-blurb { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 22px; padding-bottom: 22px; }
    .contact-card { padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .contact-headline { font-size: 34px; }
    .contact-sub { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .contact-method a, .contact-method span {
      font-size: 16px;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    .contact-form { padding: 20px; border-radius: 18px; }
    .submit-btn { padding: 14px 24px; }
  }

  /* Very small phones (< 380px) */
  @media (max-width: 380px) {
    /* Hide nav wordmark, keep only the gold diamond mark */
    .nav-brand {
      font-size: 0;
      gap: 0;
    }
    .nav-brand .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
    .section-title { font-size: 28px; }
    .portrait-tagline { font-size: 20px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ NAVIGATION ============ -->
<nav class="nav">
  <a href="#top" class="nav-brand">
    <span class="dot"></span>
    Viktor Borisov
  </a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
    <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
    <li><a href="#expertise">Expertise</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Get in touch</a>
</nav>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="hero-top">
      <p class="hero-intro">
        Compliance &amp; Regulatory Affairs Officer with six years across <em>financial crime, investigations, and policy</em> — ISO 27001 Internal Auditor, certified mediator, and reading for law.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-headline-block">
        <h2>
          Compliance built<br>
          to <span class="lime">withstand</span> scrutiny
        </h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- BRAND LOGO — the centerpiece of the hero -->
    <div class="hero-logo">
      <h1 class="logo-name">Viktor Borisov</h1>
      <div class="logo-divider">
        <span class="logo-line"></span>
        <span class="logo-dot"></span>
        <span class="logo-line"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="logo-subtitle">Compliance &amp; Regulatory Affairs</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-row">
      <div class="portrait">
        <img class="portrait-photo"
             src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"
             alt="Viktor Borisov — Compliance & Regulatory Affairs Officer">

        <div class="seal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <defs>
              <path id="circle" d="M 100,100 m -75,0 a 75,75 0 1,1 150,0 a 75,75 0 1,1 -150,0"/>
            </defs>
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="90" fill="none" stroke="#C9A961" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.4"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="60" fill="none" stroke="#C9A961" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.4"/>
            <text fill="#C9A961" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="10" letter-spacing="3">
              <textPath href="#circle">COMPLIANCE · INVESTIGATIONS · REGULATORY · LAW · </textPath>
            </text>
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="3" fill="#C9A961"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="portrait-content">
          <div class="portrait-footer">
            <h2 class="portrait-tagline">
              Trusted in <em>compliance</em>,<br>
              reading for <em>law</em>.
            </h2>
            <a href="#contact" class="portrait-cta">Get in touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-column">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3 class="stat-card-headline">
            Built on <em>six years</em> of front-line compliance work
          </h3>
          <div class="stat-list">
            <div class="stat-row">
              <span class="stat-row-label">Years in compliance</span>
              <span class="stat-row-value">06<sup>+</sup></span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-row">
              <span class="stat-row-label">Functional roles</span>
              <span class="stat-row-value">04</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-row">
              <span class="stat-row-label">ISO 27001 audits</span>
              <span class="stat-row-value">IA</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-strip">
      <span>Trusted</span>
      <span>—</span>
      <span>Experienced</span>
      <span>—</span>
      <span>Strategic</span>
      <span>—</span>
      <span>Discreet</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-meta">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span>(01) — About</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-title">
      A <em>brief</em> introduction
    </h2>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text reveal">
        <p class="lead">
          A 28-year-old Compliance &amp; Regulatory Affairs Officer reading for law — combining <span class="lime">technical</span>, <span class="lime">analytical</span>, and <span class="lime">legal</span> foundations to operate at the most demanding edge of financial regulation.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've spent the past six years working across the spectrum of financial crime and regulatory compliance — starting as a <strong>FinCrime Analyst</strong>, progressing through <strong>Investigations</strong>, then <strong>Compliance Officer</strong>, and now leading <strong>Compliance &amp; Regulatory Affairs</strong>. Every role has added a new dimension to how I think about risk, evidence, and the systems that keep institutions safe.
        </p>
        <p>
          My work is grounded in international standards — particularly the <strong>ISO 27001 / 27002</strong> framework for information security, where I'm certified as Internal Auditor by TÜV Rheinland Group. I'm also familiar with <strong>ISO 9001</strong> quality management principles, and hold further credentials from ACAMS, Chainalysis, the Basel Institute on Governance, and the Bulgarian Ministry of Justice (Certified Mediator).
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm now pursuing law at Burgas Free University to formalize the legal reasoning I rely on every day — and to bridge the worlds of practitioner and counsel.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-meta">
        <div class="meta-card">
          <div class="meta-card-label">Based in</div>
          <div class="meta-card-value">Burgas / Sofia <em>— Bulgaria</em></div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-card">
          <div class="meta-card-label">Currently</div>
          <div class="meta-card-value">Compliance &amp; Regulatory Affairs <em>Officer</em></div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-card accent">
          <div class="meta-card-label">Specialization</div>
          <div class="meta-card-value">ISO 27001 / 27002 <em>— Information Security · also familiar with ISO 9001</em></div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-card">
          <div class="meta-card-label">Languages</div>
          <div class="meta-card-value">Bulgarian, English <em>& Russian</em></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ EXPERIENCE ============ -->
<section id="experience">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-meta">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span>(02) — Experience</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-title">
      Six years, four <em>chapters</em>
    </h2>

    <div class="experience-list">

      <article class="role reveal">
        <div class="role-title">
          <h3>Compliance &amp; Regulatory Affairs Officer</h3>
          <span class="role-current">Present</span>
        </div>
        <div class="role-description">
          <ul>
            <li>Own the firm's compliance and regulatory affairs function, partnering with legal, technology, and business stakeholders on policy and control design.</li>
            <li>Lead ISO 27001 internal audit activity and information-security compliance reviews; advise on remediation across the control environment.</li>
            <li>Primary point of contact for regulator engagement, including thematic reviews, inspections, and requests for information.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="role reveal">
        <div class="role-title">
          <h3>Compliance Officer</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="role-description">
          <ul>
            <li>Designed and operated the second-line compliance monitoring program covering KYC, sanctions, and transaction monitoring controls.</li>
            <li>Closed high-priority audit findings ahead of deadline; reduced repeat findings year-on-year through root-cause remediation.</li>
            <li>Built compliance training curriculum and advised business on product launches and onboarding policy.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="role reveal">
        <div class="role-title">
          <h3>Investigations</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="role-description">
          <ul>
            <li>Led complex financial crime investigations including trade-based money laundering, sanctions evasion, and fraud rings — applying OSINT and Chainalysis tooling.</li>
            <li>Filed SARs/STRs and coordinated with law enforcement liaison on productive matters.</li>
            <li>Authored investigation playbooks adopted across the unit and trained junior analysts on evidentiary standards.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="role reveal">
        <div class="role-title">
          <h3>FinCrime Analyst</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="role-description">
          <ul>
            <li>Triaged and disposed of transaction monitoring and sanctions alerts within SLA, maintaining a high quality assurance rating.</li>
            <li>Identified typology gaps in detection scenarios and contributed to the rule-tuning cycle, improving alert precision.</li>
            <li>Supported enhanced due diligence on high-risk relationships including PEPs and complex corporate structures.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ EDUCATION ============ -->
<section id="education">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-meta">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span>(03) — Education</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-title">
      Trained in <em>practice</em>,<br>
      refining in <em>theory</em>
    </h2>

    <div class="edu-grid">
      <article class="edu-card current reveal">
        <div class="edu-label">In Progress</div>
        <h3>Law</h3>
        <div class="edu-institution">Burgas Free University</div>
        <p>Formal legal training to complement six years of compliance practice — focusing on the foundations of financial regulation, civil and commercial law, and dispute resolution.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="edu-card reveal">
        <div class="edu-label">Completed</div>
        <h3>Software Engineering</h3>
        <div class="edu-institution">Software University (SoftUni)</div>
        <p>Technical foundation in programming, systems thinking, and data analysis — the substrate that informs how I design and audit compliance technology today.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="credentials-card reveal">
      <div class="credentials-header">
        <h3>Professional <em>certifications</em></h3>
